The trace found the exact regression: both asset download and upload currently pair `JOB-TOKEN` with automatic redirect following. I’m hardening both sides: verification will manually follow a bounded HTTPS redirect chain and recompute whether authentication is allowed on every hop; uploads will reject redirects and require the Package Registry’s exact success status. Release metadata will also be checked against the three expected same-project package links before any asset download.
