codex
The first implementation pass is in place. I’ve added a real two-origin TLS loopback regression—not a curl mock—so the second origin can directly assert whether the synthetic `JOB-TOKEN` arrived. It also exercises same-origin token retention, tokenless external downloads, HTTP/missing/malformed/excessive redirects, unexpected status, and tampered release-link metadata.
